<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="600" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[Dear &lt;BPL Name&gt;]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">As many things
evolve in our world, blood collection is no different. While we remain
steadfast in our commitment to every patient who needs lifesaving blood, the
way in which blood donors serve our mission requires more flexibility than
ever. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">As someone who
has answered the call to protect patient care in your community in the past, we
hope we can count on you to help us boost the blood supply to support patients
in need. <span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><br></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Join us as a
<span style="color:#C00000">Blood Booster</span>, a public advocate connecting
willing and able blood donors to the most convenient location to donate near
them. <o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">What is
volunteer service as a Blood Booster?<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; text-indent: -0.25in;"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-family: Symbol; color: rgb(192, 0, 0);"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">·<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style="text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#c00000">&nbsp;</font></span><span style="text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Protect
the stability of the blood supply by communicating flexibility donation
opportunities for blood donors in your community.</span></p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; text-indent: -0.25in;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">
<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br style="mso-special-character:line-break">
<!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; text-indent: -0.25in;"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-family: Symbol; color: rgb(192, 0, 0);"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">·<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Be
aware and knowledgeable of blood programs in your local community and have the
ability to communicate the donation opportunities with coworkers, patrons,
family and friends. <br style="mso-special-character:line-break">
<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br style="mso-special-character:line-break">
<!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; text-indent: -0.25in;"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-family: Symbol; color: rgb(192, 0, 0);"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">·<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Act
as liaison between the American Red Cross and businesses/organizations or your
personal connections to drive donations to specific donation events in your
area<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; margin-left: 1in; text-indent: -0.25in;"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">o<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Share
the attached flyer and ask donors to download the Red Cross Blood App to
schedule their appointment<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; margin-left: 1in; text-indent: -0.25in;"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">o<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Share
info about the drives on the flyer in your social media channels or intranet<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; margin-left: 1in; text-indent: -0.25in;"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">o<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Recruit
other Blood Boosters to extend donation invitations within their networks<br style="mso-special-character:line-break">
<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br style="mso-special-character:line-break">
<!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">No matter what
role you have played in the past, or hoped to play, we need your help with today
to help boost the blood supply! We would be so grateful for your partnership!<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">To learn more about
becoming a Blood Booster, please reference the attached information sheet. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; margin-bottom: 0in;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; margin-bottom: 0in;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Thank
you!</span><o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; margin-bottom: 0in;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&lt;Red
Cross Representative Name and contact information&gt;<span style="font-size: 12pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
